  type: 1
  trashHints:
  - "I think I saw something lying in the mountains. Looked like there used to be
    food inside. Maybe the seagulls brought it there\u2026 I think you may need that
    material as well to make the item... "
  - "last week, I tried to hike up the mountain and almost cut myself on something
    silver on the ground\u2026 If you find some of these, add them to the mix, make
    sure you don't leave anything behind, okay? "
  - 'I saw something rusting near the lookout on the mountain. Who knows how long
    it has been there? But you could use them for crafting as well? '
  - "I almost stepped on something yesterday while walking around the mountain area.
    Sharp edge- be careful when walking barefoot\u2026you should add the material
    as well to make the item. "
  materialName: Metal
